exports[`Jimeng packet plan snapshots > snapshots the next gen-parity packet plan 2`] = `
"# Jimeng Packet Plan: gen-parity

- Title: Generation parity and artifact proof
- Families: G1, G2, A1
- Value rank: 1
- Artifact root: \`data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612\`
- Approval required: yes

## Objective

Prove useful image/video submit, poll, download, and artifact contracts from real or captured generation examples, then promote the relied-on paths into typed services and replay tests.

## Examples

### kbeauty-still: Korean beauty persona still

Build and compare the direct image-generation request for a persona seed asset before any fresh live submit.

- Output: \`data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/kbeauty-still\`
- Risks: fresh_capture

\`\`\`bash
bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts text2image-plan --prompt "韩系美妆UGC创作者手机自拍，干净卧室自然光，真实皮肤质感" --ratio 9:16 --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/kbeauty-still
\`\`\`

### faceless-hook-video: Faceless product hook video

Refresh text-to-video submit/poll/download proof for a short UGC hook format.

- Output: \`data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/faceless-hook-video\`
- Risks: fresh_capture, paid_generation

\`\`\`bash
bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts text2video --capture data/jimeng-captures/<fresh-gen-parity>/capture-template.raw.json --prompt "无露脸蛋白棒产品短视频，前三秒强钩子，真实手机拍摄，干净桌面" --durationSec 3 --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/faceless-hook-video
\`\`\`

### reference-omni-video: Reference-profile omni video

Capture or approve the mixed image/video reference path for pose/timing transfer.

- Output: \`data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/reference-omni-video\`
- Risks: fresh_capture, paid_generation

\`\`\`bash
bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts omni-video-plan --prompt "参考视频动作节奏，替换为韩系美妆UGC创作者展示产品" --imageUri tos-cn-i-tb4s082cfz/<persona>.png --videoVid <reference-vid> --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/reference-omni-video
\`\`\`

### material-audit: Generation material audit

Compare pre-audit material transforms used before generation submits.

- Output: \`data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/material-audit\`
- Risks: fresh_capture

\`\`\`bash
bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts generate-audit-plan --materials '[{"materialType":"image","imageUri":"tos-cn-i-tb4s082cfz/<persona>.png"}]' --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/material-audit
\`\`\`

## Approval Prompt

Approve running the gen-parity packet with concurrency 1?
Risks: fresh_capture, paid_generation.
Artifact root: data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612.
Commands/actions:
- kbeauty-still: bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts text2image-plan --prompt "韩系美妆UGC创作者手机自拍，干净卧室自然光，真实皮肤质感" --ratio 9:16 --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/kbeauty-still
- faceless-hook-video: bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts text2video --capture data/jimeng-captures/<fresh-gen-parity>/capture-template.raw.json --prompt "无露脸蛋白棒产品短视频，前三秒强钩子，真实手机拍摄，干净桌面" --durationSec 3 --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/faceless-hook-video
- reference-omni-video: bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts omni-video-plan --prompt "参考视频动作节奏，替换为韩系美妆UGC创作者展示产品" --imageUri tos-cn-i-tb4s082cfz/<persona>.png --videoVid <reference-vid> --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/reference-omni-video
- material-audit: bun packages/jimeng-client/src/browser-proxy-cli.ts generate-audit-plan --materials '[{"materialType":"image","imageUri":"tos-cn-i-tb4s082cfz/<persona>.png"}]' --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/material-audit
After the run, feed saved JSON/artifacts into contract-infer and replay tests before any promotion.

## Sample Plan

- Record credit balance before and after approved paid examples.
- Keep generation/mutation concurrency at 1.
- Save raw request/response JSON, normalized summaries, media artifacts, exact commands, and credit deltas under the packet artifact root.
- Stop immediately on ret=1019, shark/risk-control, 429, auth drift, unexpected modal, or unexpected account mutation.

## Promotion Plan

- Run \`jimeng-browser-proxy contract-infer --input data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612 --endpoint /mweb/v1/aigc_draft/generate --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/contract-infer\`.
- Run \`jimeng-browser-proxy generation-contract --input data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612 --outDir data/jimeng-lab/packet-gen-parity-20260612/generation-contract\` if result JSON includes completed generation proofs.
- Promote inferred stable paths into the typed generation client and replay fixtures.
- Update endpoint registry evidence and next probes for G1/G2/A1.

## Acceptance

- \`bun run jimeng:test\` passes.
- \`mise exec -- bun run typecheck\` passes in packages/jimeng-client.
- \`mise exec -- bun run test:vitest\` passes in packages/jimeng-client.
- Playable/listenable artifacts exist for approved media examples, or passive captures are compared by the relevant compare gate.

## Current Registry Gaps

- 1.1 \`G1 /mweb/v1/aigc_draft/generate\` partial command=text2image-plan/text2image-compare/text2video-plan/omni-video-plan/text2video-compare/omni-video-compare/generation-contract/executeJimengVideoDirectSubmit/executeJimengText2ImageSubmit/text2video/image2video/frames2video/lip-sync
  - Unified generation submit; direct image/video, first/end-frame, and Seedance omni-reference request builders are dry-run covered with semantic compare gates; direct text/video and text/image submit helpers are mock-fetch tested; saved live text/image-to-video proofs are schema-validated by generation-contract; fresh UI text-to-image capture generated completed image records, but patched direct replay still returns ret=3018 because the current frontend uses a body-bound browser signature/a_bogus context; live lip-sync/end-frame/omni-reference still require capture compare or approval-gated submit/poll/download.
  - Next: Fresh UI text-to-image submit succeeded and stable request-body compare now passes, but patched direct replay returned ret=3018 permission denied, indicating a body-bound a_bogus/msToken/browser-signature transport gap. Recover the frontend signer or add a browser-assisted signed submit path before claiming direct text2image parity; lip-sync/end-frame/multi-frame/omni-reference still need their matching compare gates before approval-gated live submit/poll/download.
- 1.1 \`G1 /mweb/v1/execute_generate_audit\` partial command=generate-audit-plan/request-plan-compare/executeJimengGenerateAudit
  - Generation pre-audit material transform is modeled and typed client replay is covered by cassettes; live replay still needs passive UI capture compare for the full frontend submit context.
